# Supabase PostgreSQL connection
# Get yours from: https://app.supabase.com/ → Project → Settings → Database → Connection string
# Direct connection (port 5432) — fine for dev. For production/serverless, prefer the pooler URL (port 6543).
# NOTE: Do NOT wrap the value in quotes — Prisma reads .env literally.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:YOUR_PASSWORD@db.YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co:5432/postgres
